## Why This Is Asked

Tests balance governance with velocity, showing the ability to scale contract testing, versioning, and regional rollout while minimizing outages. It probes tooling choices and how to communicate contracts across teams.

## Key Concepts

- Contract-first API design
- OpenAPI catalog
- Pact consumer-driven contracts
- CI/CD contract gates
- Deprecation/migration strategy
- Multi-region rollout and versioning

